  "as_of": "2022-11-09",
  "sentences": [
   "The bill would increase the Commonwealth penalty unit to $275, raising maximum monetary penalties expressed in penalty units across Commonwealth criminal legislation and territory ordinances.",
   "The higher amount would apply only to offences committed from 1 January 2023, while the regular three-year indexation cycle would continue from 1 July 2023.",
   "Courts would still determine the appropriate fine in each case, and proceedings relating to offences committed before commencement would retain the earlier penalty settings."
  ],
  "changes": [
   "The statutory penalty unit definition would be replaced with the higher dollar value.",
   "The indexation provision would substitute 2023 for its previous 2020 reference.",
   "An application rule would limit the increase to offending occurring from the amendment’s commencement."
  ],
  "affected": "People and companies liable for Commonwealth offences would be affected.",
